WEBVTT

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.856
And it marks people of color also.

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:35.416
And it makes people of color,
like white people,

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.680
vote against our interests.

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.536
Some of you might ask --

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:50.816
and my students always tell me
I give hard assignments --

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.680
some of you might ask, and rightfully so,

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.376
"How do we fix this?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.640
It seems so all-powerful
and overwhelming."